WEBVTT

00:23:29.557 --> 00:23:32.766
I like the word because it means someone
whose views are different

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:35.066
from the prevailing orthodoxy.

00:23:35.090 --> 00:23:37.556
And that certainly characterized me.

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:40.176
AG: Carmen Medina
spent years as a heretic,

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:41.806
not in a religious context,

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:44.000
but in a place almost as strict --

00:23:44.024 --> 00:23:45.576
the CIA.

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:47.926
CM: I was never a spy.

00:23:47.950 --> 00:23:52.704
I did travel to Iraq and Afghanistan.

00:23:52.728 --> 00:23:55.941
I think Afghanistan once and Iraq twice.

00:23:56.680 --> 00:24:03.196
And riding the helicopters at night --
open helicopters, by the way --